> 
> ### Name: ref_level
> ### Title: Return the reference or specific level of a factor
> ### Aliases: ref_level level
> 
> ### ** Examples
> 
> ## Don't show: 
> set.seed(1)
> ## End(Don't show)
> f <- factor(sample(letters[1:5], 100, replace = TRUE))
> 
